@startuml
 title Live GPS tracking
autonumber
participant "device GPS VT03F" as Device
participant "gps-service" as GPS
database "database of data" as DB
queue Kafka
participant "bus-service" as bus
participant "WebSocket/SSE" as Edge
actor Guardian

Device -> GPS: sends position per TCP
GPS -> GPS: validates IMEI
GPS -> DB: stores GpsLocation
GPS -> Kafka: publishes position recibida
Kafka -> bus: delivery evento
bus -> bus: updates location of the bus
bus -> Edge: new position
Edge -> Guardian: updates map
@enduml

